  "label": "Geopolitical Complexity: Terrorism is a multifaceted issue with many causes",
  "description": "The meme oversimplifies a complex geopolitical issue by reducing terrorism to a single cause (Saudi Arabia) and a single solution (annihilation). In reality, terrorism is driven by a multitude of factors including political instability, economic inequality, ideological extremism, and historical grievances, which cannot be solved by physical destruction.",
